    "synthesis_rationale": "The posterior of 0.83 arises from a Bayesian update that weights CDU momentum more heavily but tempers it with Greens closing the gap and Greens’ recent baselines. Some polls are correlated (same electorate snapshots and methods), so the effective signal is moderated to avoid overconfidence. The range 0.70–0.90 reflects remaining uncertainty due to turnout dynamics and potential polling shifts before 8 March 2026."
